{"channelId":"UCkWYei5MULuRDhH7uxtZqqA","row":["SeniorShape Fitness",877000,"Hello and welcome to SeniorShape with Lauren! I’m thrilled you have found my channel! I am an ACE (American Council on Exercise) certified fitness instructor. I also hold a specialization in senior fitness. \nIt is my passion to create fun, new exercises and routines that are never boring. \nMy videos are easy to follow and the exercises featured are specifically curated for beginners, and active older adults. The workouts are challenging and at a great pace that works well for anyone. \nPlease subscribe so you never miss a new workout.\n\nhttps://www.seniorshape.com\n\nEquipment I use or recommend can be purchased on my Amazon store page www.amazon.com/shop/seniorshapefitness\n*as an Amazon associate/influencer I earn from qualifying purchases\n\nFor those who have graciously asked to donate so I can continue to provide free videos can contribute through \nVenmo: @SeniorShape\nI appreciate your support!\n\nThanks for working out with me!\nLauren","seniorshapewithlauren@gmail.com","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCkWYei5MULuRDhH7uxtZqqA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCkWYei5MULuRDhH7uxtZqqA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:37.911Z","channelId":"UCkWYei5MULuRDhH7uxtZqqA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"b69d7c42583fb8888a9473c7556a88a0a73cf6b8174d77ab48fe5fca70ffbca4","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"1ab575405797a5f9ae026bbe98f5efcb171d5de8dab64cfa2cad2d07c1c776b2"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCkWYei5MULuRDhH7uxtZqqA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:37.911Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCkWYei5MULuRDhH7uxtZqqA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":877000,"raw":"877K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCkWYei5MULuRDhH7uxtZqqA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:37.911Z"}]